*[[ilmasto]]

===Etymology 2===

====Pronoun====
'''sää'''
# (''colloquial, in [[Häme]] dialect'') [[you]] (''addressing one person'') (''in archaic English'': [[thou]])
#:*[[mikä|Mitä]] '''sää''' [[tehdä|teet]]?
#:**What are ''you'' doing?

